      "onScreen": "founder, Align"
    },
    {
      "line": "Every dating app asks the same first question: are they hot. You decide in half a second, and you never read a word they wrote.",
      "broll": "",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "On Align your card is your sky, your words and your dealbreakers. The photo is veiled.",
      "broll": "Deck: veiled cards (#deck)",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "The first time I matched with someone this way, I already knew how they answer a hard question before I knew what they looked like.",
      "broll": "",
      "onScreen": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "You still see the face. It just comes last.",
